
<section class="phase-page testing-page">

    <h1>Test Implementation</h1>

    <p class="page-intro">
        During the Test Implementation phase, I prepared
        the manual test cases, test data, and testing tools
        needed to execute the planned scenarios on the
        Automation Exercise e-commerce website.
    </p>

    <section class="phase-section">
        <h2>Test Suite Preparation</h2>

        <p>
            I organized 13 documented manual test cases
            into four functional areas to support
            structured test execution.
        </p>

        <div class="cards-container">

            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>User Registration</h3>
                <p>
                    4 test cases covering required fields,
                    mobile number validation, duplicate
                    emails, and invalid email formats.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>User Authentication</h3>
                <p>
                    2 test cases covering successful login
                    and logout with session verification.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>Product Search</h3>
                <p>
                    3 test cases covering exact product
                    search, partial matching, and
                    searches without matching results.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>Shopping Cart</h3>
                <p>
                    4 test cases covering product addition,
                    quantities, calculated totals,
                    and product removal.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

